{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "573d36e235802bf5c29a30d64e2a8749426da2bf0f19d434d74fb39c0686c73e", "ja": "絵本の出版イベント", "zh": "绘本出版活动", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6000_place", "source_sha256": "0c480fbb40fd930e3b08c576343f9a67082904d72bfedf30d084117a0b9bee5e", "ja": "本屋の店頭", "zh": "书店门口", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6001_p", "source_sha256": "50f3d063f5016fc5c8b521a61b046d46086830ec8454c10dabf0fe13fc999bf2", "ja": "（今日は、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』と人気絵本の\nコラボイベント当日だ。さて、志保の様子は……）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》与人气绘本的联动活动日。话说，志保现在怎么样了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6002_033sih", "source_sha256": "43ba384390fd20a03ad01677b2298637306c326221046d0264ac2e05987b01bb", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nあの、今日はありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n那个，今天谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6003_033sih", "source_sha256": "090ca8deb1b37f53e6d710ae4424cd4db8398cd68714d5a2f47bfcaeb9c74756", "ja": "この絵本……子狐シリーズは、昔よく読んでたんです。\nだからイメージキャラクターに選ばれて、嬉しいです。", "zh": "这套绘本……我以前经常读小狐狸系列。\n所以能被选为形象代言人，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6004_p", "source_sha256": "2c361d9cba25d8bb0e2659395d1a9dd5596477af1071cd56ac8897e98b6fed56", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。企画を聞いた時、志保にピッタリだと\n思ってね。今日のイベント、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "哈哈，是吗？听到这个企划时，我就觉得和志保特别合适。今天的活动，我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6005_033sih", "source_sha256": "65ccd6bf4599e067eaa1eb0d457e338b0c6d6593146d854d8422e931a651527c", "ja": "はい、全力を尽くします。\nえっと……少し相談があるんですけどいいですか？", "zh": "好的，我会竭尽全力。\n那个……我有件事想和您商量，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6006_033sih", "source_sha256": "2ca4ea46dfa3a0d78ddc40f1d0bf007191de60544dd91d290b1fc8e582cfeb92", "ja": "今日は小さい子が多いと思って。人気の絵本ですし。\nだから、どう接したらいいか迷ってて……。", "zh": "我觉得今天来的小孩子会比较多。毕竟这是本很受欢迎的绘本嘛。\n所以，我有点犹豫该怎么和他们相处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6007_033sih", "source_sha256": "d71a425bfb4b6e0ce9f8f310b9d313c3c752efe698e10c163056451333b9f310", "ja": "初めてこういうイベントに来る子もいると思うんです。\nそういう子にも、楽しい思い出にしてもらいたくて。", "zh": "我想有些孩子可能是第一次参加这种活动。\n所以，也希望能让这些孩子留下快乐的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6008_p", "source_sha256": "f6e016fc4b84c21521d048c83f8a5ecdd6605d6bf0208e125c89defc58b824bc", "ja": "なるほど。そういうことなら……。", "zh": "原来如此。既然是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6009", "source_sha256": "7c0b3e2b9a4e76a63ee6e053afa66fc2ba0b301acb2a28771bba9bb2996705c3", "ja": "そのままで", "zh": "维持现状", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6010", "source_sha256": "b246c9f2da81a3682a516c0e39ebf008ef00b63ebe903f6e8508657df66290ff", "ja": "絵本の真似", "zh": "模仿绘本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6011", "source_sha256": "511ef5ae46cba70f10807d32e10de6baa45c18e18914d572a04d77fddb4bd941", "ja": "狐語で", "zh": "用狐狸语", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6100_p", "source_sha256": "02d8b710f2a7ed04b6fa07823aea037c250d4ad83fe3958a98e456f762abb923", "ja": "そのままでいいと思うよ。志保の気持ちが伝われば、\nみんなも楽しんでくれる。劇場でやることと同じだ！", "zh": "我觉得保持原样就好。只要能传达志保的心情，\n大家也会乐在其中。这和在剧场里做的事是一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6101_033sih", "source_sha256": "c94dee97d8d8edb6b41e7a9aafef804fb1ff41c42000fe207792972d3da7d68c", "ja": "あっ……。ふふっ、そうですね。素敵な思い出に\nしてあげたい、ってことばかりに気がいってて……。", "zh": "啊……呵呵，是啊。我光想着要让他们拥有美好的回忆了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6102_033sih", "source_sha256": "90bbfe60f183b7cbf51147890935337551a9f3e898be51548b9315897c96cad6", "ja": "この絵本が好きな気持ち、子ども達に伝えてみます。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "我会试着把喜欢这本绘本的心情传达给孩子们。\n谢谢您，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6200_p", "source_sha256": "7b73bc3f1c99bc7cd92318922c43bd2661e10b936ff52296ee1061334bec32c7", "ja": "絵本の主役の狐を真似してみるとか？\n志保は演技もうまいし、子ども達も喜ぶと思うよ。", "zh": "要不要试着模仿绘本里的狐狸主角？志保演技也很好，我觉得孩子们一定会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6201_033sih", "source_sha256": "d187dc8131817e0f8fb2f09a0f5bed50c3ea82c15a9bd3448c0438393c52ab68", "ja": "主役のマネですか……それなら、こほん。\n「コンコン♪　この油揚げは天国の味がするコ～ン♪」", "zh": "模仿主角吗……既然这样，那么，咳咳。\n“咚咚♪这块油豆腐有着天堂般的味道咕——♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6202_033sih", "source_sha256": "cadee92566a3e4515f124673356d7c564ce3ad6c02b5d983cf8786ef998f92bd", "ja": "こんな感じで……って、なにニヤけてるんですか？\nちゃんと聞いてないなら、もういいです……。", "zh": "大概就是这样……你在那儿傻笑什么呢？\n要是没好好听，那就算了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6300_p", "source_sha256": "d60b1d38b3e254f5304ee513aa94de5636d35048cd43cf2417f94b1260f1a817", "ja": "狐語で喋ってみるのはどうだ？　語尾にコンって\nつけたりしたら、興味を持ってくれるんじゃないか？", "zh": "要不要试着用狐狸语说话？在句尾加上“呜——”之类的，说不定就会让她产生兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6301_033sih", "source_sha256": "6a56bf6d099d703b753127786bce55aa43e8245ab36913bc2030a07c883f3780", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。知らない人が\nコンコン言いながら近づいてきたら、どう思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……如果一个陌生人一边说着“嗷嗷”一边靠近过来，你会怎么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_033sih_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_033sih_6302_033sih", "source_sha256": "dc02d58114f07e422abb8ab797c2ff243751831c3611d393f5ff02704ee3f5f7", "ja": "はあ～。アドバイスを聞いた私が悪かったです。\nすみません。", "zh": "唉～，听了您的建议是我不好。对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
